## A. Round-1 resolution

The final review in [runs/codex_boundary_guide_review.log](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/runs/codex_boundary_guide_review.log) enumerates **24 findings (7 BLOCKER / 16 MAJOR / 1 MINOR)**, rather than the 19 stated in the request and guide §10. The IDs below preserve that review’s A–E numbering.

